└── package.json (updated)
```

## Testing Instructions

After implementation:
1. Run `npm run build` - should succeed
2. Run `npm run dev` - check all pages render
3. Test Footer on multiple pages
4. Verify G clef animation works
5. Test cookie consent accept/decline
6. Check all legal page links
7. Test on mobile viewport
8. Check browser console for errors
9. Verify environment variables work when set

## Deployment Instructions

1. Set up Google Cloud project
2. Install gcloud CLI
3. Authenticate: `gcloud auth login`
4. Set project: `gcloud config set project [PROJECT_ID]`
5. Enable APIs: Cloud Run, Cloud Build, Container Registry
6. Set environment variables in Cloud Run
7. Deploy: `gcloud run deploy [app-name] --source .`
8. Set up GitHub repository with cloudbuild.yaml for CI/CD

